          %title Selected writings
          %p
            %strong Raoul Bott
            (1923–2005) was one of the great 20th century
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topology"} topologists
            and
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/geometry"} geometers
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bott+periodicity+theorem"} Bott periodicity theorem
            (of importance in
            = succeed ")," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/K-theory"} K-theory
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Morse+theory"} Morse theory
            (including the study of Bott–Morse functions), the Borel–Weil–Bott theorem in geometric representation theory, the study of fixed point (localization) formulas (the Atiyah–Bott fixed point theorem) and the Atiyah-Bott-Patodi slick proof of the index theorem via the heat kernel expansion.
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a{:href => "http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raoul_Bott"} Wikipedia entry
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Loring+Tu"}> Loring Tu
                \:
                %em The life and works of Raoul Bott
                (2002) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://legacy-www.math.harvard.edu/history/bott/bottbio/index.html"}> harvard history
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://celebratio.org/Bott_R/article/302/"} celebratio:302
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Atiyah"}> Michael Atiyah
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a{:href => "https://celebratio.org/Bott_R/article/296/"} Raoul Harry Bott: 24 September 1923 – 20 December 2005
          %h2#selected_writings Selected writings
          %p
            Introducing the concept and terminology of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pontrjagin+product"} Pontrjagin product
            on the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/ordinary+homology"} ordinary homology
            of
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/based+loop+spaces"} based loop spaces
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Raoul+Bott"}> Raoul Bott
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hans+Samelson"} Hans Samelson
              = succeed "," do
                %em On the Pontryagin product in spaces of paths
              %strong 27
              (1953) 320–337 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/BF02564566"}> doi:10.1007/BF02564566
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            and application to the case of
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lie+groups"} Lie groups
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Raoul+Bott"}> Raoul Bott
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em The space of loops on a Lie group
              %strong 5
              1 (1958) 35-61 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://projecteuclid.org/journals/michigan-mathematical-journal/volume-5/issue-1/The-space-of-loops-on-a-Lie-group/10.1307/mmj/1028998010.full"}> doi:10.1307/mmj/1028998010
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            Introducing
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bott+periodicity"} Bott periodicity
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Raoul+Bott"}> Raoul Bott
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em The Stable Homotopy of the Classical Groups
              %strong 43
              10 (1957) 933-935 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://www.jstor.org/stable/89403"}> jstor:89403
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            Introducing the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Atiyah-Bott-Shapiro+orientation"} Atiyah-Bott-Shapiro orientation
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/MSpin"} MSpin
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mo →
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KO"} KO
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/MSpin%5Ec"}
              MSpin
              %sup
                %i c
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mo →
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \to
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KU"} KU
          %ul
            %li#AtiyahBottShapiro64
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Atiyah"}> Michael Atiyah
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Raoul+Bott"} Raoul Bott
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Arnold+Shapiro"} Arnold Shapiro
              = succeed "," do
                %em Clifford modules
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0040-9383(64)90003-5"} doi:10.1016/0040-9383(64)90003-5
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://dell5.ma.utexas.edu/users/dafr/Index/ABS.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            Introducing the
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Atiyah-Bott+fixed+point+theorem"} Atiyah-Bott fixed point theorem
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+F.+Atiyah"}> Michael F. Atiyah
                ,
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Raoul+Bott"} Raoul Bott
                = succeed "," do
                  %em A Lefschetz fixed point formula for elliptic differential operators
                %strong 72
                (1966) 245-250 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1090/S0002-9904-1966-11483-0"}> doi:10.1090/S0002-9904-1966-11483-0
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://projecteuclid.org/journals/bulletin-of-the-american-mathematical-society/volume-72/issue-2/A-Lefschetz-fixed-point-formula-for-elliptic-differential-operators/bams/1183527784.pdf"} pdf
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+F.+Atiyah"}> Michael F. Atiyah
                ,
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Raoul+Bott"} Raoul Bott
                = succeed "," do
                  %em A Lefschetz Fixed Point Formula for Elliptic Complexes: I
                %strong 86
                2 (1967) 374-407 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.2307/1970694"}> doi:10.2307/1970694
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://www.jstor.org/stable/1970694"} jstor:1970694
          %p
            On
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+K-theory"} topological K-theory
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Raoul+Bott"}> Raoul Bott
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    Lectures on
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi K
                          %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                          %mi X
                          %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} K(X)
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://www.maths.ed.ac.uk/~v1ranick/papers/bottk.pdf"} pdf
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Bott-KTheory.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
              %p
                Russian transl. by B. Yu. Sternin, Matematika
                %strong 11
                2 (1967) 32–56 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://www.mathnet.ru/eng/mat424"}> mathnet:mat424
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            On the
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chern-Weil+homomorphism"} Chern-Weil homomorphism
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Raoul+Bott"}> Raoul Bott
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em On the Chern-Weil homomorphism and the continuous cohomology of Lie-groups
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0001-8708(73)90012-1"} doi:10.1016/0001-8708(73)90012-1
          %p
            On
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+forms"} differential forms
            in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/algebraic+topology"} algebraic topology
          %ul
            %li#BottTu82
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Raoul+Bott"}> Raoul Bott
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Loring+Tu"} Loring Tu
              = succeed "," do
                %em Differential forms in algebraic topology
              = succeed "," do
                %strong 82
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://link.springer.com/book/10.1007/978-1-4757-3951-0"} doi:10.1007/978-1-4757-3951-0
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://www.maths.ed.ac.uk/~v1ranick/papers/botttu.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            On the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/simplicial+de+Rham+complex"} simplicial de Rham complex
            and
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivariant+de+Rham+cohomology"} equivariant de Rham cohomology
          %ul
            %li#BottShulmanStasheff76
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Raoul+Bott"}> Raoul Bott
